            .init(heading: "Your data lives in your iCloud", paragraphs: ["Items, item photos, outfits, calendar, body photos, colour analysis and settings are saved on your device and in your private iCloud. The developer cannot read them. The app also works without iCloud: in that case they stay on the device only."]),
