            .init(heading: "What leaves your device", paragraphs: ["Weather: for the forecast, Apple Weather receives the rounded coordinates of your position, if you choose \"My location\", or those of the chosen city. Apple also receives your city search text. Coordinates are not saved to any account.", "Shop links: if you paste a link, your device opens that page directly to read its title and image.", "Reports: if you use \"Report a problem or an idea\", the text you write and some technical details (app version, device model, iOS version, language) reach the developer by email. If you write by email, we receive what you write.", "Shops and external services: the colour analysis links and those to ChatGPT and Gemini open the browser or those services' apps, under their own terms."]),
