            .init(heading: "If you try clothes with ChatGPT or Gemini", paragraphs: ["The AI prompt prepares a text and photos, but the app sends nothing by itself. Only if you choose to paste them do those photos reach OpenAI or Google, under their terms. The app asks you before continuing. Only use photos of yourself or of someone who agreed."]),
            .init(heading: "Why we use it", paragraphs: ["To provide the service you ask for (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR) and to answer reports and improve the app (your request and legitimate interest, Art. 6(1)(f)).", "There are no ads, no tracking across apps or websites, no analytics tools, and we never sell data."]),
            .init(heading: "Who processes data for us", paragraphs: ["Apple: iCloud, Sign in with Apple, Apple Weather, city search.", "Supabase: sign-in and reports, with servers in the European Union (Ireland).", "Google: only if you sign in with Google.", "Resend: sends reports by email, based in the United States with the safeguards the GDPR requires for transfers outside the EU."]),
            .init(heading: "How long we keep it", paragraphs: ["Data in your iCloud stays as long as you keep it. Your account stays until you delete it: at that point we delete the account and anything left on the old website, and the provider's backups are overwritten within a few days. Report emails stay in the developer's inbox for as long as needed to handle them."]),
            .init(heading: "Your rights", paragraphs: ["You can ask for access, correction, deletion, portability, restriction or objection by writing to lorefara97@gmail.com, and you can complain to the Italian data protection authority (Garante). Profile → Export my data gives you a copy of everything in a file right away."]),
